OL,4,CBoy admits starting fire that killed   
OL,5,Celderly couple                         
OL,6,GA 15-year-old boy threw a lit          
OL,7,Gcigarette into a bin causing a fire    
OL,8,Gwhich spread to a house killing the    
OL,9,Gelderly couple who lived there, a      
OL,10,Gcourt has heard.                       
OL,12,FStan Rickman, 91, and his wife Roma,   
OL,13,F88, were found dead at their home in   
OL,14,FHeron Close, Alton, Hampshire, in the  
OL,15,Fearly hours of 14 April 2025.          
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
