OL,4,CAuthority could hire event managers    
OL,5,Cfor state visits                       
OL,6,GA council's plan to hire a company to  
OL,7,Gmanage its role at major events,       
OL,8,Gincluding at Windsor Castle, is set to 
OL,9,Gget the go-ahead.                      
OL,11,FThe Royal Borough for Windsor and      
OL,12,FMaidenhead (RBWM) said it had a "key   
OL,13,Frole" in supporting state events, but  
OL,14,Femploying specialists full-time was    
OL,15,Ftoo expensive.                         
OL,17,FIt proposed signing an initial 10-year 
OL,18,Fcontract with event managers to ensure 
OL,19,Fit "can respond quickly and            
OL,20,Feffectively".                          
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
