OL,4,CBiker arrested after man seriously     
OL,5,Churt in crash                          
OL,6,GA man is being treated for life-       
OL,7,Gthreatening injuries after being       
OL,8,Gstruck by a motorbike.                 
OL,10,FThe crash happened in Bournemouth      
OL,11,FRoad, Ashley Cross, Poole, shortly     
OL,12,Fafter 20:30 GMT on Sunday.             
OL,14,FThe injured man, who is in his 50s,    
OL,15,Fwas taken to hospital. His next of kin 
OL,16,Fhas been informed.                     
OL,18,FThe motorcyclist, a man in his 20s     
OL,19,Ffrom Bournemouth, has been arrested on 
OL,20,Fsuspicion of driving offences, Dorset  
OL,21,FPolice said.                           
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
