OL,4,CCat statue unveiling celebrations in   
OL,5,Ctown centre                            
OL,6,GA long-awaited statue of a beloved     
OL,7,Groaming feline has been unveiled in a  
OL,8,Gtown centre.                           
OL,10,FResidents, artists, writers, musicians 
OL,11,Fand animal lovers in Dorchester,       
OL,12,FDorset, gathered to celebrate Susie    
OL,13,Fthe cat, who has achieved local        
OL,14,Fcelebrity status by making herself at  
OL,15,Fhome in pubs, shops and supermarkets.  
OL,17,FA bronze statue - depicting her as a   
OL,18,FRoman-era cat as a nod to the town's   
OL,19,Forigins - was created by sculptor Ama  
OL,20,FMenec.                                 
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
